WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.625 --> 00:00:03.458
- Oh hell yeah, man, football is back—

00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:05.166
Oh hell no, Antonio.

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:06.666
- THIS IS CLEARLY NOT TO CODE—

00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:07.666
- IF I CAN'T LIVE HERE,

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:08.791
I'M LEAVING GRIDIRON—

00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:12.291
- Thanks so much, guys!

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:13.291
My leg’s been trapped under

00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:14.708
this vending machine all summer!

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:15.375
- HEY GUYS,

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:17.458
THERE’S BEEN ANOTHER ANTONIO BROWN THING!

00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:18.125
- Woah!
- Gotta check that out!

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:19.291
- Haha, that’s OK!

00:00:19.291 --> 00:00:20.041
Wait. 

00:00:20.041 --> 00:00:21.166
Maybe it’s NOT OK...

00:00:21.166 --> 00:00:22.083
- Alright, I played nice.

00:00:22.083 --> 00:00:23.000
I moved houses.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.541
- A.B., you clearly just painted your old Steelers house.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:27.541
- IF A.B. WANTS TO BUILD ON A CLIFF,

00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:29.083
LET HIM BUILD ON A CLIFF.

00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:31.000
- I’M SICK OF A.B.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:31.541
Up Next:

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:34.000
The Top ONE THOUSAND A.B. Offseason Moments.

00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:36.875
- Not everyone can be besties like Coach and I!

00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:37.500
- PLEASE HELP!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.500
AARON HURT MY LEG AND HE SAID HE’LL DO IT AGAIN—

00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:43.083
- Does anyone even care I’m training on a beach again?

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:44.083
- A.B.! A.B.!
- Antonio!

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:45.083
- ENOUGH.

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:47.125
I can’t do this anymore

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.500
I’m leaving lol.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.083
- NO!

00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:49.750
- You can do that?

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:50.416
- Remember:

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:52.916
You can always find me in the throw of a football….

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:54.208
WEEEEE!!!!!

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:56.750
- Was Andrew Luck real or just a dream we all had?

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:57.583
- He was real.

00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:58.750
He was damn real.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.000
- AHHH!

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:04.708
Subscribe to this channel by double-doinking below.

00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:06.208
I mean double-clicking.

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:07.333
Double-kick below—

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.333
WHO BROUGHT UP KICKING?

00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:09.291
-Uh, you did, Coach.

00:01:09.291 --> 00:01:10.083
No I doinkn’t.

00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:11.083
I mean, I DIDN’T.

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.416
I DOUBLE DOINK DIDN’T. 

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:13.708
I’M OVER THE DOUBLE DOINK.

